{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0574_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d168f3228aaaaed7fb52c90f78af05f57b95aee610571499da93b01cb498dc66", "ja": "（BOTシリーズ連動ドラマの撮影日。今日の\nメインキャスト、探偵役を演じるのは……美希だ！）", "zh": "（今天是BOT系列联动剧的拍摄日。今天的主角，也就是侦探一角的扮演者……是美希！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0574_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "27f49b01e2d40581fd4f1bdfd12cdeee528c508838c48733af832c1467f27a0d", "ja": "容疑者のアリバイ、現場に残った証拠……\n最初から全部、答えは揃っていたの。", "zh": "嫌疑人的不在场证明、现场遗留的证据……\n从一开始，所有的答案就都已经集齐了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0574_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "97cbad906112a482a60c2e9b07f6543df27f9b4e5b73b6056a63b5c4a50eae52", "ja": "あとはこの答えを並べて示すだけ……。\n事件の結末まで、ミキが案内してあげるの！", "zh": "接下来只要把这些答案罗列出来展示给大家看就好……。\n就由美希来带路，一直走到案件的终局吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0574_1003_p", "source_sha256": "7e654d71b4c76b89fe20f31be5067b4efb280f13edb3bba17ca7bba5b9d24a9d", "ja": "……お疲れ様。\n結構な長丁場だけど、体力は大丈夫か？", "zh": "……辛苦了。\n虽然时间挺长的，但体力还撑得住吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0574_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "7a2dcad803e852d1e3fb98e03807972386e6c147b3b7ee4a00cc4407c361d5c9", "ja": "うん！　大変だけど、けっこう楽しいし。\nあとちょっとで撮影終わるから、がんばるの。", "zh": "嗯！虽然挺辛苦的，但也相当有意思。\n再过一会儿拍摄就结束了，所以要加油。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0574_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b636f29be999dd56333ab3c60e53a758e1bbab893a7dc10fdb871acf28d6c8f8", "ja": "そうか。しかし……今日の美希は、なんだか\nいつも以上に元気だな。演技もすごくいい感じだし。", "zh": "这样啊。不过……今天的美希总觉得比平时还要有精神呢。演技也特别棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0574_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "c66f06562f489d494718185ef09993527a4ba953478c159b73389f905e8bfe28", "ja": "うん。だってミキのキャラクター、\n家で推理する役だから、あんまり動かないでしょ？", "zh": "嗯。因为美希的角色，\n是个在家里推理的人物，所以都不怎么需要动嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0574_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "405c5d8050a03af3de1b38ee0a2b4b43266dc5b09856cd435339ac1c43b560e0", "ja": "だからすっごくラクちんなの♪\nミキのお気に入りの役になっちゃった。あはっ☆", "zh": "所以特别轻松嘛♪\n结果变成美希最喜欢的角色了。啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0574_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0a10a939bf820674e4b2df8dc896642f3c18f6faae4206ec68061770e0581e9f", "ja": "気に入ったって、そっちか？　やる時はやる！\nっていう、カッコいい一面とかじゃなくて？", "zh": "你说的“喜欢”，指的是那个啊？不是那种“该出手时就出手”的帅气一面吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0574_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "0670ee29aa8945df5e0cce6848283735cdde430d6e3278ac3314f6108979c046", "ja": "そこもいいなって思うけど……でも、ミキ的には、\nのんびり事件を解決してるところが羨ましいの～。", "zh": "那一面我也觉得很好啦……不过，对美希来说，还是很羡慕那种悠哉悠哉解决事件的样子～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0574_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "21db0fe65508f8ab64b0dceaee60f01c827a14342228a8e537ec086463f81dda", "ja": "大事な捜査も、仲間の律子、さん……あ、\nさんはつけなくてもいいんだっけ？", "zh": "重要的搜查也是，伙伴律子、小姐……啊，\n其实不用加“小姐”也可以来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0574_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "5d8dc2e80ae187c1687da2c83d2226102f8b189ccd2cfbcc3a5ed31d4ceb061e", "ja": "律子に任せて、お昼寝してるでしょ？　でも、\nちゃんと事件は解決して……大活躍って感じなの！", "zh": "全都交给律子，自己跑去睡午觉对吧？可是，\n最后还好好地解决了案件……感觉超大显身手的呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0574_1012_p", "source_sha256": "079db953d8c7b6a2cac91f397aaff55dbe86d0073563ce3c919f9a011b76b8b4", "ja": "まあ、そこも魅力なのは確かだからな……。\nなるほど、羨ましいか……。", "zh": "确实，那也是魅力所在就是了……\n原来如此，你很羡慕啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0574_1013_p", "source_sha256": "dd05b1d0ae254b966ba5503066dcaa9ce9d628a29852e8db876699823055e434", "ja": "実際の美希で言うと、劇場にずっとこもったまま\nトップアイドルになる……みたいなことか。", "zh": "拿现实中的美希来打比方，就是一直窝在剧场里\n成为顶尖偶像……这样的感觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0574_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "9723fcd4cd6cb8a457b62dabab5c502b6cfbad9f434ffa0b6a62cce15474cf1e", "ja": "それ、最高なの♪　遠くに行ったりも\nしなくてよくて、すっごくラクだって思うな～。", "zh": "那样最好了♪ 不用跑到很远的地方去，我觉得特别轻松呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0574_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "eb660285a1517d6dcd5d6fedb127e84da098ecc1bc1d9308e40c8fb74e40b4f1", "ja": "あっ……でもそれって、{$P$}と\n一緒にいられる時間が減るってこと……？", "zh": "啊……不过那样的话，不就意味着和{$P$}待在一起的时间会变少吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0574_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "ed3c8a1224df5116a6e15936eb60e29b4e85054d89850a9f279d561b048e1229", "ja": "やっぱり、今のナシなの～！", "zh": "刚才的话果然不算数啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0574_1017_p", "source_sha256": "f1fb594c8e746af0863e6be7a2b88f65d387cd130080735529a84ff960c1952f", "ja": "どうしたんだ、急に。", "zh": "怎么了，这么突然。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0574_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "eec343fcd372087194d2bc0ef1add15bd63f893e2e335e03f163f9bc9728c768", "ja": "だって……ミキが、ずーっと劇場にいても、\n{$P$}はお仕事に行くでしょ？", "zh": "因为……就算美希一直待在剧场里，{$P$}也还是要去工作吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0574_1019_p", "source_sha256": "823921912166fc6e6aff8e3f8782c428d94d5e66a18cba4dcd71dd74e89212d9", "ja": "うん。仕事だからな。", "zh": "嗯。毕竟是工作嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0574_1020_003mik", "source_sha256": "90ccdf1eb4601a612cdacabc13a5b2468699975eb6a5d68ae4fc3adff525787a", "ja": "そんなのダメ～！　{$P$}と\n離ればなれになっちゃうのは、ヤ！なの！", "zh": "那样不行啦～！　和{$P$}\n分开什么的，讨厌！不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0574_1021_003mik", "source_sha256": "f0f96a4b20aa8ffdbe4f3a0b76f9eae24c72afd050fee79ad85df63f734a98c6", "ja": "ハニーは、ミキがトップアイドルになるまで\n傍にいてくれなくちゃ。そうでしょ？", "zh": "亲爱的，在美希成为顶尖偶像之前，必须一直陪在美希身边哦。对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0574_1022_p", "source_sha256": "296439cb924daf633b51f7e38cf279445fb274da50adebba55d8bca11824ccfe", "ja": "もちろん、そうだけど。なら、\nキャラクターの真似はほどほどに……ってとこかな。", "zh": "当然是那样了。不过这么一来，\n模仿角色是不是也该适可而止……这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0574_1023_003mik", "source_sha256": "73d968665dc050021d37c908d0445a8f4b84d31bd8bc8719b3a2ed218751ace9", "ja": "うん！　ミキ、アイドルは自分でがんばるの。\nあ、でもこの役は、のんびりやるけどね♪", "zh": "嗯！美希会靠自己努力成为偶像的。\n啊，不过这个角色嘛，就慢悠悠地来吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
